{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37283","headline":"采茶歌 · 秦韬玉","name":"采茶歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天柱香芽露香发，烂研瑟瑟穿荻篾。\n太守怜才寄野人，山童碾破团团月。\n倚云便酌泉声煮，兽炭潜然蚪珠吐。\n看着晴天早日明，鼎中飒飒筛风雨。\n老翠香尘下才熟，搅时绕筯天云绿。\n耽书病酒两多情，坐对闽瓯睡先足。\n洗我胸中幽思清，鬼神应愁歌欲成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秦韬玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37283.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37283","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}